        },
        "text_rDzkTQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The Universal Soft Breast Pump Flange Inserts are made from soft, flexible material to conform gently to your breast shape. These silicone insert pieces fit snugly into the standard Ameda flange, offering a cushioned surface that can help minimize discomfort during pumping. Ideal for new moms or anyone who experiences nipple pain or friction, these inserts support comfortable pumping sessions without compromising suction strength.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
