    "media_with_text_CKF9Tw": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_DgTLNx": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ameda CustomFit Breast Pump Flanges™ and Inserts",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_A7fFxQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every mom is unique — and so are her pumping needs. That’s why Ameda offers the CustomFit Breast Pump Flanges™ and Inserts, a versatile range of multiple size options to help most moms find their right flange size. Whether you need a smaller flange tunnel for a more secure vacuum seal or a larger funnel shape for better comfort, this customizable system ensures that your breast pump flange works for you. A proper fit not only supports better milk flow but also helps prevent soreness, elastic nipples, and potential discomfort around the areola.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_DgTLNx",
        "text_A7fFxQ"
      ],
