    "multi_column_eEEejx": {
      "type": "multi-column",
      "blocks": {
        "column_46tWVB": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/accessible.png",
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Start with the Right Fit",
            "text": "<p>Begin by taking a measurement of your nipple size (diameter) and comparing it to Ameda’s flange sizing chart. Remember, your nipple should move freely within the flange tunnel without rubbing against the sides. If your breast tissue or areola is pulled in, or if the elastic causes your nipples to stretch uncomfortably, the flange may be too large.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_FzyVi9": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/comfort.png",
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Consider Comfort & Positioning",
            "text": "<p>If pumping feels uncomfortable or painful, even with the proper size, soft silicone piece inserts like the Universal Soft Breast Pump Flange Inserts can add an extra layer of cushioning. Angled flanges also improve your posture during pumping, helping you maintain a relaxed and effective position.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_YwUGqD": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/convenience.png",
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Seek Professional Guidance",
            "text": "<p>If you’re unsure about your fit, working with a lactation consultant can help you identify the size and style specifically designed for your needs. This is especially helpful for new moms who are still adjusting after pregnancy. For help finding a lactation consultant, visit our <a href=\"https://www.ameda.com/pages/lactation-support\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">lactation support page</span></a>.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "column_46tWVB",
        "column_FzyVi9",
        "column_YwUGqD"
      ],
