    "multi_column_aw7EBy": {
      "type": "multi-column",
      "blocks": {
        "column_QwQ7PT": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/accessible.png",
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Clean Before First Use",
            "text": "<p>Always wash your breast pump flanges, inserts, and other parts before the first use and after every pumping session. Many moms find it convenient that Ameda flanges and inserts can be placed on the top rack of a dishwasher (check product guidelines) or simply hand-washed. Follow Ameda’s cleaning steps to keep your equipment safe for your baby.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_pLekhX": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/comfort.png",
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Check the Fit Regularly",
            "text": "<p>Your breast size can change throughout your breastfeeding journey — typically as your milk supply adjusts post-pregnancy. Reassess your flange size if pumping becomes uncomfortable or if milk flow decreases. Making sure the flange fits directly around your areola without tugging too much breast tissue can protect against damage.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_7JtdpW": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/convenience.png",
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Try Different Options",
            "text": "<p>If one flange type isn’t working for you, don’t hesitate to try Ameda’s CustomFit Flanges™ or the Comfort Fit Angled Flange. This can ensure the proper size and maintain optimal pumping efficiency as you progress in your breastfeeding journey.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
