        },
        "text_KVerg6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Achieving pumping efficiency begins with choosing the right flange size. This ensures the flange tunnel properly aligns with your nipple and creates a strong vacuum seal without causing discomfort. When your flange fits correctly, you can express the maximum amount of milk in less time, reducing the risk of nipple pain or friction. For most moms, a well-fitting flange significantly boosts milk output and shortens pumping sessions, making it easier to keep up with your baby’s needs.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
