          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "A Learning Curve for Moms",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_REdFVY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For new moms, finding the best flange fit can feel overwhelming. There’s a natural learning curve, especially right after pregnancy, when breasts are still adjusting to milk production. Even most moms who have pumped before may need to reassess size and comfort as they progress through their breastfeeding journey. By experimenting with multiple size options and consulting resources like lactation experts, you’ll set yourself up for a smoother, more confident start.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
